ists of one upper-trunk curl and return of the upper back to the floor. Setup and the exit after the set do not add repetitions."},"load":{"fr":"Saisir la masse réelle de chaque haltère, unité explicite, sans ajouter le poids du corps. Deux mains sur un seul haltère ne doublent pas sa masse.","en":"Enter the actual mass of each dumbbell with an explicit unit, excluding body mass. Holding one dumbbell with two hands does not double its mass."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"DB_099","pilot":{"sourceId":"DB_099","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Redressement assis avec haltère contre le thorax","en":"Chest-held dumbbell weighted sit-up"},"equipment":{"id":"dumbbell","labels":{"fr":"Haltères","en":"Dumbbells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Allongez-vous sur le dos, pieds au sol et haltère maintenu contre le thorax.","execution":"Relevez le tronc vers les cuisses en gardant la charge contre le thorax et les appuis retenus.","finish":"Reposez progressivement le dos, bassin au sol, sans laisser tomber la charge."},"en":{"setup":"Lie on your back with your feet on the floor and one dumbbell held against your chest.","execution":"Raise your torso toward your thighs, keeping the load against your chest and maintaining the specified supports.","finish":"Gradually lower your back while keeping your pelvis on the floor and controlling the load."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Convention proposée: une répétition comprend u