, poignée diagonale.","execution":"Fléchir hanches et genoux; conserver rack droit. Squat bas maîtrisé, talons posés, cloche au rack droit.","finish":"Se redresser sans inclinaison vers la charge."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with one bell in the right-hand rack and both feet stable.","execution":"Squat while keeping the right rack and both heels planted.","finish":"Stand without leaning toward the loaded side."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_036","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_036","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Squat avec kettlebell overhead unilatérale","en":"Single-Arm Kettlebell Overhead Squat"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell droite tenue au-dessus épaule droite. Pied droit légèrement devant gauche. Deux pieds au sol. Main droite, bras chargé long.