e avec kettlebell overhead","en":"Single Kettlebell Overhead Reverse Lunge"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell droite overhead, fond derrière avant-bras. Pied gauche recule; pied droit reste devant. Deux pieds. Main droite, coude allongé contrôlé.","execution":"Pas arrière gauche puis flexion des deux genoux. Demi-agenouillement proche du sol; cloche droite reste au-dessus épaule.","finish":"Pousser pied droit, revenir debout sans dévier charge."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with the right-hand bell overhead and space behind you.","execution":"Step the left foot back and bend both knees, keeping the right-hand bell above its shoulder.","finish":"Push through the right foot to stand without letting the bell drift."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_041","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_041","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion