i média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_054","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_054","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Tirage haut balistique à une kettlebell","en":"Single Kettlebell High Pull"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell main droite. Appuis largeur épaules. Deux pieds. Main droite ferme sur poignée.","execution":"Étendre hanches puis ramener coude droit vers arrière pour rapprocher cloche. Cloche devant épaule droite à hauteur thorax, coude fléchi.","finish":"Réallonger bras et laisser charge revenir entre cuisses en charnière."},"en":{"setup":"Hinge with one bell in your right hand and both feet stable.","execution":"Drive your hips, then draw your right elbow back to bring the bell toward chest height.","finish":"Lengthen the arm and guide the bell between your thighs as you hinge."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_057","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_057","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Swing kettlebell à deux mains overhead","en":"Overhead Two-Hand Kettlebell Swing"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell tenue deux mains. Pieds stables largeur épaules. Deux pieds. Deux mains en pronation sur poignée.","execution":"Impulsion hanches puis poursuite du trajet haut avec contrôle des épaules. Cloche au-dessus tête, bras longs, côtes maîtrisées.","finish":"Guider descente devant puis entre cuisses en charnière."},"en":{"setup":"Hold one bell with both hands in a stable swing stance.","execution":"Drive your hips and guide the swing to a controlled overhead position without flaring your ribs.","finish":"Guide the bell down in front and back between your thighs as you hinge."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisab