.","execution":"Bend both elbows to bring the bell toward your sternum without lifting your elbows.","finish":"Straighten both elbows to lower the bell in front of your thighs."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_075","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_075","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Curl kettlebell unilatéral","en":"Single-Arm Kettlebell Biceps Curl"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell dans main droite, masse sous poignée. Debout stable. Deux pieds. Main droite supination, poignet aligné.","execution":"Fléchir coude droit sans clean ni impulsion hanches. Main droite près épaule, masse de cloche sous/arrière poignée selon prise.","finish":"Allonger coude lentement près flanc."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with one bell in your right hand, palm up and upper arm b