.","finish":"Revenir centre puis tourner vers gauche en miroir."},"en":{"setup":"Sit with knees bent, feet planted and one bell held close to your sternum.","execution":"Turn your chest to the right while keeping your pelvis controlled and the bell close.","finish":"Return to centre, then turn left without aiming for a floor contact."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_079","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_079","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Pull-over kettlebell au sol","en":"Kettlebell Floor Pullover"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell tenue deux mains au-dessus poitrine, au sol. Dos au tapis, genoux fléchis, pieds posés. Dos et bassin au sol, deux pieds. Deux mains sécurisées sur poignée.","execution":"Abaisser charge vers arrière tête en bougeant aux épaules. Charge derrière tête dans amplitude sans cambrure, coudes quasi fixes.","finish":"Ramener cloche au-dessus poitrine par même arc."},"en":{"setup":"Lie with feet planted and one bell securely held in both hands above your chest.","execution":"Move the bell in an arc behind your head with nearly fixed elbows and no back arch.","finish":"Bring it back over your chest along the same arc."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_080","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_080","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Crunch avec kettlebell sur poitrine","en":"Kettlebell Weighted Crunch"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell stable à deux mains contre poitrine. Dos au tapis, genoux fléchis, pieds posés. Bassin, dos initialement et deux pieds. Deux mains sur cornes.","execution":"Rapprocher côtes du bassin et décoller omoplates. Petite flexion du tronc; bassin reste posé, charge contre poitrine.","finish":"Reposer omoplates lentement sans lancer charge."},"en":{"setup":"Lie with knees bent, feet planted and one bell held securely against your chest.","execution":"Curl your ribs toward your pelvis and lift your shoulder blades, keeping your pelvis down.","finish":"Lower your shoulder blades slowly without throwing the bell."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_081","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_081","sourceVersion":"1.2.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Marche kettlebell au rack unilatéral","en":"Single Kettlebell Front-Rack Carry"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell contre avant-bras droit, main près épaule droite. Marche naturelle dans couloir libre. Pieds alternés. Main droite au rack, coude près côtes.","execution":"Faire avancer pied gauche puis droit, kettlebell droite conservée au rack. Après trajet, debout stable avec rack droit.","finish":"Arrêter la marche en conservant le rack; préparer ensuite la dépose contrôlée de cloche droite. La boucle du clip utilise uniquement le cycle des pieds, sans demi-tour ni dépose."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with one bell at the right rack and a clear walking lane.","execution":"Walk forward with alternating steps while keeping the bell at the right rack.","finish":"Stop with both feet stable and keep the rack before preparing the separate controlled exit."}},"performance":{"measure":"distance","counting":{"fr":"Aucune répétition assimilée aux pas : relever la distance réellement parcourue pendant le maintien du port ou du déplacement décrit, hors installation et dépose.","en":"Do not treat each step as a repetition: record actual distance travelled during the described loaded carry or locomotion, excluding setup and putting the load down."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"distance"},{"source_id":"KB_083","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_083","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Marche kettlebell overhead unilatérale","en":"Single Kettlebell Overhead Carry"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell droite overhead. Marche naturelle dans couloir libre. Pieds alternés. Main droite; bras long au-dessus épaule.","execution":"Faire avancer pied gauche puis droit, kettlebell droite conservée au-dessus de son épaule. Après trajet, debout stable avec bras droit overhead.","finish":"Arrêter marche avant retour au rack/dépose; boucle = cycle des pieds, sans demi-tour."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with one bell stabilized above the right shoulder and a clear lane.","execution":"Walk forward with alternating steps, keeping the right arm long and the bell overhead.","finish":"Stop before lowering the bell to the rack and preparing the exit."}},"performance":{"measure":"distance","counting":{"fr":"Aucune répétition assimilée aux pas : relever la distance réellement parcourue pendant le maintien du port ou du déplacement décrit, hors installation et dépose.","en":"Do not treat each step as a repetition: record actual distance travelled during the described loaded carry or locomotion, excluding setup and putting the load down."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"distance"},{"source_id":"KB_091","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_091","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Good morning avec kettlebell","en":"Kettlebell Good Morning"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell soutenue derrière haut du dos, dégagée de la colonne. Pieds bassin, genoux légèrement souples. Deux pieds. Deux mains maintiennent la charge derrière les épaules; prise à confirmer.","execution":"Reculer bassin en inclinant thorax sans augmenter fortement flexion genoux. Charnière contrôlée, colonne longue et charge toujours soutenue.","finish":"Étendre hanches pour revenir debout sans cambrer."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with soft knees and one bell supported behind your shoulders, clear of your spine.","execution":"Push your hips backward to hinge while retaining the reviewed two-hand grip.","finish":"Extend your hips to stand without leaning backward; confirm the grip before demonstration."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_092","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_092","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Épaulé kettlebell fond en haut","en":"Bottoms-Up Kettlebell Clean"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une cloche au sol entre pieds. Pieds stables. Deux pieds. Main droite sur poignée, poignet aligné sous cloche inversée à réception.","execution":"Étendre hanches et rapprocher cloche du thorax, coude près flanc. Coude fléchi, masse de cloche au-dessus poignée; stabiliser sans rotation autour poignet.","finish":"Abaisser avec contrôle près corps et reposer au sol."},"en":{"setup":"Place one bell between your feet and grip its handle with the right hand.","execution":"Extend your hips and guide the bell close to receive it inverted, base above the handle, near the right shoulder.","finish":"Stabilize, then lower close to your body and replace it on the floor."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_106","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_106","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Pistol squat avec kettlebell","en":"Kettlebell Pistol Squat"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une cloche goblet utilisée en contrepoids. Pied droit seul; jambe gauche longue devant. Pied droit. Deux mains cornes, goblet près thorax.","execution":"Fléchir hanche-genou droits en avançant jambe gauche libre. Squat unipodal dans amplitude contrôlée, talon droit posé.","finish":"Étendre jambe droite et retrouver debout sans poser gauche."},"en":{"setup":"Stand on your right foot with the left leg long in front and one bell goblet-style.","execution":"Lower into a right-leg squat within your controlled range, keeping the right heel down.","finish":"Extend the right leg to stand without placing the left foot on the floor."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_108","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_108","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Développé Sots kettlebell","en":"Kettlebell Sots Press"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell droite. Squat bas soutenu par deux pieds, talons posés. Deux pieds; aucune assise. Main droite au rack puis bras haut.","execution":"Développer bras droit sans remonter bassin. Bras droit haut stable, squat bas conservé.","finish":"Replier coude et retrouver rack en gardant même hauteur de bassin."},"en":{"setup":"Hold a low squat on both feet with heels down and one bell at the right rack.","execution":"Press the right bell overhead without raising your pelvis.","finish":"Return to the right rack while retaining the same squat height."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"lb"},{"source_id":"KB_111","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_111","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Windmill kettlebell en demi-agenouillement","en":"Half-Kneeling Kettlebell Windmill"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell droite haute. Genou droit au tapis, pied gauche devant écarté pour appui. Genou droit, pied gauche, puis main gauche au sol. Main droite chargée overhead, gauche libre.","execution":"Incliner torse à gauche et conduire main gauche vers sol à gauche du bassin. Main gauche soutient au sol, bras droit chargé reste haut.","finish":"Redresser torse sans pousser la charge; retrouver demi-agenouillement vertical."},"en":{"setup":"Half-kneel on your right knee, left foot forward, with the right-hand bell overhead.","execution":"Incline your torso left and place your left hand on the floor beside your pelvis while retaining the high right arm.","finish":"Return your torso upright without pressing the bell farther upward."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : saisir séparément la masse de chaque cloche; une prise à deux mains ne crée pas deux charges.","en":"Proposed convention: enter each bell mass separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les 