 separately; holding one bell with two hands does not make it two loads."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"per_implement"}},"default_unit":"distance"},{"source_id":"KB_118","pilot":{"sourceId":"KB_118","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Hip thrust unilatéral avec kettlebell","en":"Single-Leg Kettlebell Hip Thrust"},"equipment":{"id":"kettlebell","labels":{"fr":"Kettlebells","en":"Kettlebells"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Une kettlebell calée sur pli de hanche avec protection adaptée. Pied droit au sol, jambe gauche décollée devant. Haut du dos sur banc stable et pied droit au sol. Deux mains stabilisent la cloche sur bassin, sans la soulever.","execution":"Pousser dans pied droit et étendre hanche droite. Bassin haut dans alignement tronc-cuisse droite, jambe gauche libre.","finish":"Abaisser bassin sans perdre appui du dos ni prise sur cloche."},"en":{"setup":"Support your upper back on a stable bench, right foot planted and left leg lifted, with one bell secured at your hip crease.","execution":"Push through the right foot to lift your pelvis into alignment with the right thigh.","finish":"Lower your pelvis while retaining the bench support and both hands on the bell."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately wh