D","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_016","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_016","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Squat avec tube sous les pieds","en":"Resistance Tube Squat"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Centre sous deux semelles; extrémités tenues près épaules. Pieds largeur confortable. Deux poignées près épaules.","execution":"Fléchir hanches et genoux sans changer hauteur mains relative au torse. Squat contrôlé; talons au sol.","finish":"Étendre jambes pour se relever; bande se rallonge."},"en":{"setup":"Stand on the tube with both feet and hold its handles beside your shoulders.","execution":"Squat with both heels down and keep your hands fixed relative to your torso.","finish":"Extend your hips and knees to stand against the tube."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier,