 is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_045","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_045","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Adduction d’épaule avec bande","en":"Anchored Band Shoulder Adduction"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Ancrage externe à droite hauteur taille; bande vers main droite latérale. Côté droit proche ancrage. Deux pieds. Main droite, coude long.","execution":"Ramener bras droit contre flanc par adduction. Main droite proche cuisse droite, torse fixe.","finish":"Réouvrir bras vers ancrage avec contrôle."},"en":{"setup":"Stand with your right side near a waist-height anchor and the band in your long right arm.","execution":"Bring the right arm toward your side without leaning your trunk.","finish":"Open it back toward the anchor under control."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convent