e repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_052","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_052","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Rotation interne épaule bras écarté avec bande","en":"Band Shoulder Internal Rotation at 90 Degrees Abduction"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Ancrage externe derrière hauteur main haute; bande dans main droite. Debout, humérus droit écarté hauteur épaule. Deux pieds. Coude fléchi, poignet droit.","execution":"Tourner humérus en interne pour amener avant-bras vers devant. Avant-bras droit devant à hauteur coude, sans translation épaule.","finish":"Ramener main vers haut sous contrôle."},"en":{"setup":"Set the anchor behind the raised right hand, upper arm out near shoulder height and elbow bent.","execution":"Rotate the upper arm inward to bring the forearm forward without shifting the shoulder.","finish":"Return the hand upward under control."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_053","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_053","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Face pull avec tube","en":"Resistance Tube Face Pull"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube à ancrage externe devant hauteur visage, deux poignées. Face ancrage, pieds décalés. Deux pieds. Deux prises neutres.","execution":"Tirer mains vers côtés visage, coudes s’écartent et reculent. Poignées de chaque côté tête, épaules sans haussement excessif.","finish":"Allonger bras pour revenir devant."},"en":{"setup":"Face a front anchor near face height with staggered feet and a handle in each hand.","execution":"Draw the handles beside your face as the elbows move outward and backward.","finish":"Straighten the arms in front without shrugging or leaning."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_054","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_054","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Écarté inverse penché avec bande sous pieds","en":"Bent-Over Band Reverse Fly"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Bande sous deux semelles; extrémité de même côté dans chaque main. Charnière de hanches, genoux souples. Deux pieds. Deux prises neutres, coudes légèrement souples.","execution":"Ouvrir bras latéralement en gardant angle coudes quasi fixe. Bras ouverts dans plan du thorax, bassin immobile.","finish":"Ramener mains sous épaules sans redresser torse."},"en":{"setup":"Stand on the band with both feet, hinge and hold the same-side ends with softly bent elbows.","execution":"Open both arms sideways without changing the elbow bend or your pelvis position.","finish":"Bring your hands beneath your shoulders while keeping the hinge."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_055","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_055","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Écarté inverse assis avec bande","en":"Seated Band Reverse Fly"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Bande fixée devant hauteur épaules assises; une extrémité dans chaque main. Assis droit sur chaise face ancrage. Bassin sur chaise, deux pieds au sol. Prises neutres, coudes légèrement souples.","execution":"Écarter bras sur arcs horizontaux sans plier coudes davantage. Bras ouverts côtés, coudes proches du plan des épaules.","finish":"Ramener bras devant en gardant torse droit."},"en":{"setup":"Sit upright facing an anchor at seated-shoulder height, feet planted and an end in each hand.","execution":"Open both arms along horizontal arcs while keeping the elbows softly bent.","finish":"Bring your arms back in front without leaning your torso."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_056","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_056","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Développé pectoral assis avec bande ancrée","en":"Seated Anchored Band Chest Press"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube ancré derrière hauteur poitrine assise; deux poignées. Assis chaise stable dos à ancrage. Bassin et deux pieds. Deux prises confortables, poignets droits.","execution":"Pousser deux poignées devant thorax sans pencher torse. Bras longs devant poitrine.","finish":"Replier coudes et revenir mains près poitrine."},"en":{"setup":"Sit on a stable chair facing away from a seated-chest-height anchor with handles beside your chest.","execution":"Press both hands in front without leaning your trunk.","finish":"Bend your elbows to return the handles beside your chest."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_057","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_057","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Développé pectoral ascendant avec bande ancrage bas","en":"Low-Anchor Band Incline Chest Press"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube ancré bas derrière au niveau sol; deux poignées. Debout dos à ancrage, appuis décalés. Deux pieds. Deux poignées, poignets alignés.","execution":"Pousser mains en diagonale vers haut devant. Deux bras longs vers haut devant dans axe confortable.","finish":"Ramener poignées près épaules sans cambrer."},"en":{"setup":"Stand facing away from a low rear anchor with staggered feet and handles near your shoulders.","execution":"Press both hands diagonally upward and forward without arching your back.","finish":"Bring the handles back near your shoulders under control."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_058","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_058","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Développé pectoral descendant avec bande ancrage haut","en":"High-Anchor Band Decline Chest Press"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube ancré haut derrière au-dessus tête; deux poignées. Dos à ancrage, pieds décalés. Deux pieds. Deux prises pronation confortable.","execution":"Pousser poignées devant et légèrement vers bas. Bras longs devant bas thorax, dos stable.","finish":"Revenir poignées poitrine sous contrôle."},"en":{"setup":"Stand facing away from a high rear anchor with staggered feet and a handle in each hand.","execution":"Press both hands forward and slightly down in front of your lower chest.","finish":"Return the handles toward your chest under control."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_059","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_059","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Écarté pectoral avec bande ancrée derrière","en":"Mid-Anchor Band Chest Fly"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube fixé derrière à hauteur poitrine; extrémité vers chaque main par côtés. Dos à ancrage, pieds décalés. Deux pieds. Deux prises neutres, coudes souples à angle stable.","execution":"Rapprocher mains devant sternum sans faire mouvement de press. Mains rapprochées devant, coudes toujours souples.","finish":"Réouvrir bras avec contrôle."},"en":{"setup":"Stand facing away from a chest-height rear anchor with staggered feet and soft elbows.","execution":"Bring both hands together in front of your sternum while keeping the elbow bend unchanged.","finish":"Open your arms back under control rather than turning the movement into a press."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_060","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_060","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Poussée scapulaire unilatérale avec bande","en":"Single-Arm Band Serratus Punch"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Bande fixée derrière hauteur épaule droite; main droite seule. Dos à ancrage, pieds décalés. Deux pieds. Main droite, coude long non verrouillé.","execution":"Avancer main par protraction de scapula sans plier coude ni tourner torse. Scapula droite avancée autour thorax, main légèrement plus loin.","finish":"Ramener scapula vers neutre, bras reste long."},"en":{"setup":"Face away from an anchor behind the right shoulder and hold the band in the long right arm.","execution":"Reach the right hand a little farther forward by moving the shoulder blade around your ribs, without turning your trunk.","finish":"Bring the shoulder blade back toward neutral while keeping the elbow long."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_061","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_061","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Tirage bras longs vers bas avec bande","en":"Band Straight-Arm Pulldown"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube ancré haut devant au-dessus tête; deux poignées. Face ancrage, légère charnière. Deux pieds. Deux poignées neutres, coudes longs souples.","execution":"Abaisser deux bras vers cuisses sans flexion importante des coudes. Mains proches cuisses, bras longs.","finish":"Relever bras vers ancrage sous contrôle."},"en":{"setup":"Face a high front anchor with both handles, soft elbows and a slight hip hinge.","execution":"Draw both long arms down toward your thighs without bending the elbows farther.","finish":"Raise your arms toward the anchor under control."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_062","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_062","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Traction pronation assistée par bande","en":"Band-Assisted Pull-Up"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Grande boucle adaptée aux tractions, fixée à barre overhead puis sous semelle droite; pied gauche croise devant cheville droite pour sécuriser. Corps suspendu vertical; jambe droite dans boucle. Deux mains à barre; semelle droite soutenue par bande. Pronation, mains légèrement plus larges que épaules.","execution":"Fléchir coudes pour monter corps sans balancement. Menton atteint hauteur barre sans projeter tête.","finish":"Redescendre contrôlé jusqu’aux bras longs; bande s’allonge."},"en":{"setup":"Use the reviewed loop under your right sole from the overhead bar, left foot crossed over the right ankle, and take a slightly wide overhand grip.","execution":"Pull your body upward without swinging until your chin reaches bar height without craning your neck.","finish":"Lower to long arms under control and use the reviewed mounting and exit method."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante. La bande assiste le poids du corps; ne pas la soustraire de la masse corporelle.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension. The band assists bodyweight; do not subtract it from body mass."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_063","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_063","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Traction supination assistée par bande","en":"Band-Assisted Chin-Up"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Grande boucle adaptée aux tractions, fixée à barre overhead puis sous semelle droite; pied gauche croise devant cheville droite pour sécuriser. Corps suspendu vertical; jambe droite dans boucle. Deux mains à barre; semelle droite soutenue par bande. Supination, mains largeur épaules.","execution":"Fléchir coudes pour monter corps sans balancement. Menton atteint hauteur barre sans projeter tête.","finish":"Redescendre contrôlé jusqu’aux bras longs; bande s’allonge."},"en":{"setup":"Use the reviewed loop under your right sole from the overhead bar, left foot crossed over the right ankle, and take a shoulder-width underhand grip.","execution":"Pull your body upward without swinging until your chin reaches bar height without craning your neck.","finish":"Lower to long arms under control and use the reviewed mounting and exit method."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante. La bande assiste le poids du corps; ne pas la soustraire de la masse corporelle.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension. The band assists bodyweight; do not subtract it from body mass."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_064","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_064","sourceVersion":"1.2.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Crunch à genoux avec bande haute","en":"Kneeling Band Abdominal Crunch"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Tube fixé haut devant la personne agenouillée; deux poignées tenues près des épaules, segments à l’extérieur des bras sans contact avec la tête. À genoux face à l’ancrage; bassin au-dessus genoux. Deux genoux et tibias au tapis.","execution":"Enrouler thorax en rapprochant côtes du bassin. Tronc fléchi sans tirer seulement avec bras ni s’asseoir sur talons.","finish":"Redresser thorax sous contrôle vers départ."},"en":{"setup":"Kneel facing a high anchor, hips above your knees and handles near your shoulders with band segments outside the arms and clear of the head.","execution":"Curl your ribs toward your pelvis without pulling only with the arms or sitting onto your heels.","finish":"Uncurl your chest under control to the starting kneel."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en":"Editorial exercise requiring review, for staging tests only. No machine model or media is approved. Actual resistance is never calculated automatically."},"loadEntryBasis":"band_configuration"}},"default_unit":"configuration"},{"source_id":"BA_067","pilot":{"sourceId":"BA_067","sourceVersion":"1.1.0","sourceCatalogVersion":"4.0.0-unified.1","integrationVersion":"fe-program-pilot.1","usage":"STAGING_TEST","name":{"fr":"Rotation du tronc assis avec bande","en":"Seated Band Trunk Rotation"},"equipment":{"id":"band","labels":{"fr":"Élastiques","en":"Resistance bands"}},"instructions":{"fr":{"setup":"Bande fixée côté gauche hauteur nombril assis; deux mains devant nombril. Assis sur chaise, bassin stable. Bassin et deux pieds. Deux mains réunies contre ventre.","execution":"Tourner thorax vers droite sans glisser bassin. Torse tourné confortablement à droite, mains toujours près ventre.","finish":"Revenir face devant lentement."},"en":{"setup":"Sit on a stable chair with an anchor to your left at seated-navel height and both hands against your abdomen.","execution":"Turn your chest right without sliding your pelvis on the seat.","finish":"Return to face forward slowly."}},"performance":{"measure":"repetitions","counting":{"fr":"Un cycle comprend le trajet actif décrit et le retour contrôlé à son départ; compter séparément les côtés lorsque repetition_basis vaut per_side.","en":"One cycle includes the described active movement and controlled return to its start; count sides separately when repetition_basis is per_side."},"load":{"fr":"Convention proposée : enregistrer le montage élastique, sans conversion en masse ou tension constante.","en":"Proposed convention: record the elastic setup without converting it into mass or constant tension."},"countingDecision":"PROPOSED","notes":{"fr":"Fiche éditoriale à vérifier, utilisable uniquement pour les essais staging. Aucun modèle de machine ni média n’est approuvé. Aucune résistance réelle n’est calculée automatiquement.","en